# No automatic builds

Do not run `xcodebuild`, `swift build`, or other compile/build commands after each change.

Only build when the user explicitly asks, when verifying a reported compile error, or when a change clearly cannot be validated without a build.

After edits, rely on the linter and code review instead of building by default.
